The Swarm ships no model. It fetches, at the request of the person running it, model files published by others, each under
its own license:
  LFM2.5 2.6B   Liquid AI   LFM Open License v1.0
  Bonsai 2 2B   Prism ML    Apache License 2.0

It can call, where the person running it has started one, a Kev decision model (github.com/jaredpalmer/kev, Apache License
2.0). The Swarm ships none of Kev and starts none of it.

The dashboard (ui/) carries two typefaces, each under the SIL Open Font License 1.1 (ui/fonts/OFL-*.txt):
  Figtree, Instrument Serif
